<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Khun Borom</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Khoun Borom</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Khun Borom is the legendary ancestor of the Lao and other Tai peoples in Lao chronicles. According to the tradition, he was sent from heaven to rule at Muang Thaen, near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-dien-bien-phu">Dien Bien Phu</a>, and his seven sons founded the principalities of the Tai world, among them Muang Sua, later <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/luang-prabang">Luang Prabang</a>. Lao royal houses traced their descent from him.</p></div>
